A sonar ping reveals all mines in a 3x3 tile area without the danger of setting them off. It comes with a 20 second cost added to your time.	HelpWindow		声纳脉冲可以显示 3x3 方块区域内的所有地雷，而不会造成引爆的危险。它会增加您 20 秒的时间。
